# RE:GEN AI — Environment Configuration
#
# Gemini AI Key (optional — enables AI-powered narrative layer)
# Without this key, RE:GEN AI runs fully on deterministic rule-based analysis.
# All outputs remain valid. Gemini only enhances the executive summary,
# top-action explanation, and waste recommendations.
#
# Get a free key: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Copy this file to .env and fill in your key.
# .env is gitignored — never commit your actual key.
